      <h2 id="oauth-delete-tokens_managing-oauth-access-tokens" class="group scroll-mt-20">Deleting user-owned OAuth access tokens<a href="#oauth-delete-tokens_managing-oauth-access-tokens" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
